Subject: [PATCH] Speed up Rust dev builds and CI with dev opt-level, sccache,
 fastcheck

- Add [profile.dev.package."*"] opt-level = 1 at workspace root
- Add .cargo/config.toml with parallel build jobs
- Wire mozilla-actions/sccache-action into CI, cross-check, and release
- Add scripts/fastcheck.sh with -p for scoped cargo check
- Log decision in CONTEXT.md
